    },
    {
      "key": "run.approval-notes",
      "value": "human:muskan on \u0027clarification\u0027 (requester): Fixed window of 60 create requests per API key per minute. Over the limit returns 429 with a Retry-After header. Counters live in process; no shared store, no distributed coordination. Only POST /api/v1/links is limited. Requests without an API key are limited by client IP on the same terms.\nhuman:alex on \u0027architecture\u0027 (tech-lead): In-process fixed-window limiter is proportionate; revisit if the service is ever run multi-instance.",
      "revisions": 2
    },
